# Environment variables.
# .env IS committed for Lovable's build (contains only the public VITE_*
# Supabase publishable values — RLS-protected, safe by design).
# Real secrets (DB passwords, access tokens, API keys) belong in Supabase
# function secrets or Lovable's secret manager — never in this file.
# .env.local stays gitignored for personal overrides.
.env.local
.env.*.local

# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

